# Supply-chain hygiene (see vault Claude/Preferences.md → Project Initialization).
# Carried forward from 01-structured-extraction.
#
# ⚠️ This file MUST live next to package.json. npm resolves project config from
# the directory containing package.json — it does NOT walk up to the repo root.
# A root-level .npmrc here is decorative; verify with `npm config get ignore-scripts`.

# Block install-time lifecycle scripts (preinstall/postinstall/binding.gyp) —
# the mechanism every recent compromise in the 2026 campaign rode on.
ignore-scripts=true

# Registry cutoff from the June 2026 npm campaign (Miasma/Red Hat wave) — NOT
# carried forward, deliberately. As of 2026-07-29 it is ~7 weeks stale, and the
# outstanding audit findings (postcss, sharp, brace-expansion) are transitive
# deps pinned by Next itself, so the cutoff neither causes nor fixes them.
# Re-add if a new campaign is active:
# before=2026-06-08
